                "description": "Text prompt for generation. Describes the target content, style, camera language, or character actions. Maximum 20,000 characters. You can refer to an uploaded reference by tag: <IMAGE_REF_N> is the Nth entry in reference_images and <VIDEO_REF_N> is the Nth entry in reference_videos (0-based, so the first reference image is <IMAGE_REF_0>).",
